## Image optimisation sources (originals live here; wwwroot gets the resized output).
## The masters are large and only needed to re-run `npm run build:images` — the resized
## WebP copies under wwwroot/ are what the app actually serves, and those stay tracked.
assets/

## NOTE: wwwroot/tailwind.css is generated by `npm run build:css` but is deliberately
## tracked, because the MSBuild target that regenerates it only runs when node_modules/
## exists. A deploy host without npm relies on the committed copy.

